meta {
  name: Look
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/games/{{gameId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{guestToken}}
}

docs {
  Read player two's own view of the game.
  
  The view holds your hand, already split into the melds it can make and the cards left
  over, and it holds the opponent as a card count. It never holds the opponent's hand or
  the order of the stock.
  
  Read `phase` to learn what the game waits for, and `arrangement.deadwoodValue` to learn
  whether you can knock. A player can knock at ten or under.
}
